  ('Eiffel Tower Exposition Grounds','France',48.8584,2.2945,1889,'/rounds/round-001.svg','The scene is curated around the newly built Eiffel Tower and the Paris Exposition Universelle grounds.','Iron lattice tower, Seine-side exhibition halls, dense European boulevard layout.','Gas lamps, late-19th-century fair architecture, formal hats and horse-era streets.','Manual curated demo. Check that no modern skyline, cars, or signage appear in final imagery.','approved','manual',2,true),
  ('Times Square Victory Crowd','United States',40.7580,-73.9855,1945,'/rounds/round-002.svg','The round represents Times Square during victory celebrations at the end of World War II.','Canyon of tall commercial buildings, Broadway-style electric signs, dense Manhattan street grid.','1940s clothing, wartime crowd behavior, period cars, victory/newspaper references.','Manual curated demo. Verify sign typography and vehicles are mid-1940s New York, not later neon styles.','approved','manual',2,true),
  ('Brandenburg Gate and Berlin Wall','Germany',52.5163,13.3777,1989,'/rounds/round-003.svg','The round centers on Berlin during the fall of the Wall near the Brandenburg Gate.','Concrete barrier, Brandenburg Gate silhouette, broad central European avenue.','Late Cold War clothing, graffiti-covered wall, 1980s cameras and crowds.','Manual curated demo. Avoid post-reunification construction details or modern Berlin street furniture.','approved','manual',2,true),
  ('Shibuya Olympic City','Japan',35.6595,139.7005,1964,'/rounds/round-004.svg','The image is curated to suggest Tokyo in the year it hosted the Summer Olympics.','Dense Tokyo commercial streets, Japanese signage, pedestrian crossing geometry.','1960s cars, Olympic motifs, mid-century clothing and storefront design.','Manual curated demo. Confirm signage and vehicles are plausible for 1964 Tokyo.','approved','manual',3,true),
  ('Kennedy Space Center Launch Complex','United States',28.5729,-80.6490,1969,'/rounds/round-005.svg','The round represents an Apollo-era launch site on the Florida coast.','Flat coastal launch complex, rocket gantry, water and marshland near Cape Canaveral.','Apollo-era equipment, white launch suits, 1960s mission-control aesthetic.','Manual curated demo. Check weather, vegetation, and launch hardware match Florida and Apollo 11 era.','approved','manual',3,true),
  ('Abbey Road Crossing','United Kingdom',51.5321,-0.1774,1969,'/rounds/round-006.svg','The round is based on the recognizable London zebra crossing associated with Abbey Road.','British zebra crossing, brick walls, London residential-studio street context.','Late-1960s clothing, older cars, analog shopfront details.','Manual curated demo. Avoid showing the location name or Beatles text directly in the image.','approved','manual',2,true),
  ('Trafalgar Square VE Day','United Kingdom',51.5080,-0.1281,1945,'/rounds/round-007.svg','This curated round depicts central London crowds celebrating Victory in Europe Day.','Nelson column context, central square, stone civic architecture, Union flags.','Wartime uniforms, 1940s coats and hats, VE Day celebration atmosphere.','Manual curated demo. Confirm no postwar buses, modern traffic lights, or contemporary signage appear.','approved','manual',2,true),
  ('Red Square Parade','Russia',55.7539,37.6208,1945,'/rounds/round-008.svg','The scene points to Moscow Red Square in the immediate postwar parade period.','Kremlin wall colors, onion-dome/Spasskaya-style silhouettes, large ceremonial square.','Military parade formation, WWII-era uniforms and vehicles, postwar Soviet banners.','Manual curated demo. Validate uniforms and flags for 1945 and avoid later Cold War missile parade elements.','approved','manual',3,true),
  ('Chernobyl Reactor Zone','Ukraine',51.3890,30.0990,1986,'/rounds/round-009.svg','The round is curated around the Chernobyl nuclear disaster zone in 1986.','Soviet industrial blocks, reactor complex shapes, flat wooded exclusion-zone landscape.','1980s Soviet response vehicles, radiation warning symbols, disaster cleanup cues.','Manual curated demo. Avoid Pripyat amusement-park clichés if the selected image predates public evacuation imagery.','approved','manual',4,true),
  ('Tiananmen Square Demonstrations','China',39.9055,116.3976,1989,'/rounds/round-010.svg','This round represents Beijing civic demonstrations in Tiananmen Square in 1989.','Very large paved square, monumental Chinese civic architecture, bicycle-heavy streets.','Late-1980s clothing, protest banners, analog cameras and period buses.','Manual curated demo. Ensure imagery is respectful and does not introduce later skyline elements.','approved','manual',4,true),
  ('Woodstock Festival Fields','United States',41.7015,-74.8809,1969,'/rounds/round-011.svg','The round evokes the Woodstock festival fields near Bethel, New York.','Open rural field, temporary stage, rolling hills and crowd camping layout.','Late-1960s counterculture clothing, tents, analog stage equipment and posters.','Manual curated demo. Check rural northeastern US landscape and avoid modern festival infrastructure.','approved','manual',2,true),
  ('Maracanã World Cup Final','Brazil',-22.9122,-43.2302,1950,'/rounds/round-012.svg','The round is curated around the Maracanã during the 1950 FIFA World Cup final.','Large oval stadium bowl, Rio urban backdrop, football pitch geometry.','Mid-century football kits, packed terraces, 1950s broadcast and crowd styling.','Manual curated demo. Avoid modern seating, floodlights, advertising boards, or roof changes.','approved','manual',3,true),
  ('Sydney Opera House Opening','Australia',-33.8568,151.2153,1973,'/rounds/round-013.svg','The scene focuses on Sydney Harbour around the Opera House opening period.','Harbor water, sail-like shells, nearby bridge and quay context.','Early-1970s clothing, opening ceremony crowds, film-camera color palette.','Manual curated demo. Ensure the Opera House appears complete and avoid modern Circular Quay towers.','approved','manual',1,true),
  ('Golden Gate Bridge Opening','United States',37.8199,-122.4783,1937,'/rounds/round-014.svg','The round represents San Francisco Bay around the opening of the Golden Gate Bridge.','Orange suspension towers, bay fog, steep coastal terrain.','1930s automobiles, pedestrian opening-day crowds, pre-war clothing.','Manual curated demo. Validate bridge completion state and period-correct cars.','approved','manual',1,true),
  ('Mount Rushmore Construction','United States',43.8791,-103.4591,1941,'/rounds/round-015.svg','The image is curated around Mount Rushmore near the end of its construction period.','Granite presidential faces, Black Hills rock texture, scaffolding over monument.','Work platforms, 1930s/1940s construction clothing, pre-modern safety gear.','Manual curated demo. Confirm which faces were complete for the selected year and avoid modern visitor facilities.','approved','manual',3,true),
  ('Suez Canal Crisis Port Said','Egypt',31.2653,32.3019,1956,'/rounds/round-016.svg','The round depicts Port Said during the Suez Crisis period.','Canal-side port cranes, Mediterranean waterfront, low Egyptian port architecture.','1950s military convoy, period uniforms, mid-century ships and smoke.','Manual curated demo. Check climate and architecture: no snowy mountains, no Gulf skyscrapers, no modern container port.','approved','manual',4,true),
  ('D-Day Normandy Beach','France',49.3778,-0.8794,1944,'/rounds/round-017.svg','The round is based on Normandy beach landings during D-Day.','Wide tidal beach, landing obstacles, low French coastline and bluffs.','WWII landing craft, helmets, uniforms and 1940s military vehicles.','Manual curated demo. Keep the image historically respectful and avoid postwar memorial structures.','approved','manual',3,true),
  ('Hiroshima Peace Memorial Area','Japan',34.3955,132.4536,1945,'/rounds/round-018.svg','This round references Hiroshima and the area now associated with the Peace Memorial.','River delta city layout, ruined dome landmark context, Japanese urban street plan.','1945 devastation cues, absence of modern high-rises, wartime/post-blast materials.','Manual curated demo. Validate sensitive content and avoid modern memorial landscaping if targeting 1945.','approved','manual',4,true),
  ('Cape Town City Hall Mandela Speech','South Africa',-33.9253,18.4239,1990,'/rounds/round-019.svg','The round depicts Cape Town City Hall around Nelson Mandela’s first speech after release.','Edwardian city hall facade, Table Mountain region context, South African flags/crowds.','1990 clothing, press cameras, anti-apartheid banners and late-20th-century vehicles.','Manual curated demo. Verify balcony/crowd composition and avoid modern street upgrades.','approved','manual',3,true),
  ('Hong Kong Handover Ceremony','Hong Kong',22.2820,114.1720,1997,'/rounds/round-020.svg','The round is curated around Hong Kong at the 1997 handover ceremony.','Victoria Harbour skyline, dense high-rises, ceremonial waterfront setting.','1990s suits, flags, rain-soaked ceremony cues, late colonial/early SAR symbols.','Manual curated demo. Confirm flags and skyline fit 1997, not contemporary Hong Kong.','approved','manual',2,true);
